data: {"id": "7eaa2ab8e8e94fda-thinking-parallel_evidence-1440", "run_id": "7eaa2ab8e8e94fda", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 2. 根因事实梳理与结论\n\n#### **已确认事实（来自实时工具）**\n| 维度 | 事实 |\n|---|---|\n| **Pod 状态** | `phase: Pending`，`nodeName: <none>`，`PodScheduled: False (Unschedulable)` |\n| **调度事件** | 30m 及 5m26s (x5) 重复触发 `FailedScheduling`，原文：\"**persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found**\" |\n| **Pod YAML** | 定义了一个 volume `input`，挂载 `PersistentVolumeClaim` 名称为 `unavailable-claim` |\n| **PromQL 基线** | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}` = 1，`Running` = 0；无重启记录 |\n| **日志/追踪** | 日志 `empty`、追踪 `empty`（Pod IP 为空，未调度到任何 ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789115593308, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

