data: {"id": "7eaa2ab8e8e94fda-final", "run_id": "7eaa2ab8e8e94fda", "seq": 1445, "ts_ms": 1789115606652, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v03/workload` | Pending | Pod workload in aiops-case-v03 namespace is stuck in Pending state. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | pod.condition | `PodScheduled=False`, reason: `Unschedulable`, message: `0/3 nodes are available: persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found.` | 明确展示调度失败的真实原因（PVC 缺失） |\n| 2 | K8s Event | event.message | `Warning FailedScheduling 30m default-scheduler 0/3 nodes are available: persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found.` | 佐证调度器因 PVC 不存在而反复失败的事实 |\n| 3 | K8s State | pod.status | `status: Pending`, `phase: Pending` | 确认 Pod 因上述调度失败而长期处于 Pending 状态 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | resource | `request.cpu=5m`, `request.memory=8Mi`, `limit.cpu=50m`, `limit.memory=32Mi` | 排除资源配额（CPU/内存）或集群节点资源不足导致的调度失败 |\n| 5 | Metric | kube_pod_status_phase | `phase: Pending`, `value: 1` (单样本, 无趋势) | 独立于 K8s API 确认当前集群中有 1 个处于 Pending 状态的 Pod |\n\n**证据关联说明**\nK8s API 的状态字段与事件消息高度一致，均明确指向名为 `unavailable-claim` 的 PVC 缺失。资源配置数据显示请求值极低且未触及硬限制，直接排除了资源竞争因素；Metrics 确认了 Pod 当前持续处于 Pending 状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n未找到 PersistentVolumeClaim \"unavailable-claim\" → 调度器在绑定卷阶段失败 → FailedScheduling (PVC not found) → Pod 卡在 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：Pod 声明挂载了一个名为 `unavailable-claim` 的 `PersistentVolumeClaim`，但该 PVC 在 `aiops-case-v03` 命名空间中不存在。这导致 `default-scheduler` 在尝试调度时判定无可用节点，并持续抛出 `FailedScheduling` 事件，使 Pod 始终无法进入 `Running` 状态（证据 1、2、3）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 23.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 32.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v03/workload: 32.3s (Evidence 26.8s, RCA 5.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v03/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 63.193, "metrics": {"run_id": "7eaa2ab8e8e94fda", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 63.19471192359924, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 63194.71192359924, "llm_calls": 9, "llm_duration_ms": 59882.01189041138, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 8786.942958831787, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3048.23899269104}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 23066.49899482727, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 32284.474849700928, "success": true}